{"updated":"2026-10-05T09:45:42.322Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Brazil heads to run-off as Bolsonaro pulls off shock first place finish in first round. Elsewhere, yemen's government declares major operation against Houthis. And sass Jordan, Canadian rock singer-songwriter, dies aged 65. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 0.7 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.5 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 3.7 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 45 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.5 near Volcano Islands, Japan region. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.29,0.34,0.38,0.42,0.46,0.5,0.53,0.56,0.59,0.61,0.66,0.78,0.87,1.02,1.26,1.38,1.43,1.46,1.49,1.53,1.56,1.58,1.6,1.65,1.7,1.76,1.82,1.87,1.9,1.94,1.99,2.02,2.06,2.1,2.15,2.18,2.22,2.26,2.31,2.36,2.4,2.45,2.51,2.58,2.63,2.75,2.87,3.02,3.05,3.1,3.12,3.18,3.23,3.3,3.41,3.5,3.56,3.63,3.68,3.74,3.79,3.83,3.88,3.9,3.94,3.98,4,4.03,4.05,4.1,4.14,4.23,4.28,4.35,4.41,4.47,4.53,4.56,4.62,4.64,4.7,4.82,4.97,5.14,5.75,5.83,5.89,5.93,6,6.09,6.18,6.26,6.29,6.33,6.37,6.42,6.47,6.53,6.56,6.59,6.68,6.72,6.78,6.83,6.87,6.91,6.98,7.05,7.11,7.2,7.23,7.29,7.34,7.41,7.49,7.56,7.63,7.7,7.81,7.91,7.99,8.06,8.1,8.16,8.22,8.29,8.34,8.39,8.43,8.5,8.53,8.6,8.64,8.7,8.77,8.8,8.84,8.95,9.01,9.08,9.14,9.21,9.25,9.32,9.37,9.44,9.51,9.58,9.61,9.66,9.7,9.76,9.81,9.86,9.9,9.97,10.05,10.12,10.18,10.3,10.36,10.43,10.5,10.55,10.59,10.66,10.73,10.82,10.88,10.94,11.06,11.19,11.63,11.75,11.81,11.87,11.91,11.96,12.02,12.05,12.12,12.2,12.25,12.37,12.45,12.53,12.59,12.64,12.68,12.72,12.76,12.81,12.84,12.9,12.93,12.97,13,13.05,13.07,13.11,13.14,13.18,13.24,13.28,13.35,13.41,13.48,